{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"notes\": {\n    \"甲\": \"甲版清楚建立了珍惜之物仍有分量、因此不愿被失落定义、于是努力维持姿态、而自持不能消除眷恋反使每次重新聚力更急更难安稳的因果链，也解释了庄严与脆弱为何能够并存；但它对38–43小节的回落、44–65小节再次聚力及后段呼吸般的焦灼缺少具体对应，没有充分展开身体先于理解的反应，也没有把不甘放弃作为独立的心理动因说清楚。\",\n    \"乙\": \"乙版既解释了熟悉感为何带来温暖却同时加深失落，也说明了挺直自持如何暂时收束悲伤、却因无法真正安顿在乎而变得越来越费力，并将段内起伏、身体先行、反复用力和末尾未获释然连成因果，还独立解释了不甘放弃的动因；不足是H1、H2及M编号对缺少前文的读者不够自足，部分心理映射也超出了听感记录直接确认的范围，但这些问题没有掩盖其主要机制。\"\n  },\n  \"verdict\": \"乙 版不差于 甲 版\",\n  \"why\": \"乙版保留了甲版的核心因果链，又更具体地解释了段内转折、身体反应、自持如何反过来加深不安，以及不甘放弃为何能够独立成立，因此在解释力上至少不低于甲版。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "e5fb5421-e7dd-41fb-a351-155f99761d2a", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T135418463875Z", "elapsed_seconds": 60.984, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T13:55:19.440876+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "cdedb8df354567b6a39c10dbc9082468508791760671f704a0fa705724cceef7", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa